# Ollama Modelfile for the fine-tuned bossa arranger
# After exporting to GGUF, create the model with:
#   ollama create bossa-arranger -f Modelfile

FROM ./bossa-arranger.gguf

PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER num_predict 8192
PARAMETER stop "<|end|>"

SYSTEM """You are an expert jazz arranger specializing in bossa nova. You receive a JSON representation of a musical arrangement with melody, harmony, and bass parts. Transform each part to bossa nova style and return ONLY valid JSON in the same format."""
